					"code" : "onepole(inp, c, last) {\n\treturn (1 - abs(c)) * inp + c * last;\n}\r\n\r\nHistory coef(0.99985);\r\nHistory lag1(0);\nHistory lag2(0);\nHistory lag3(0);\r\nthresh=0.0001;  \r\nif (change(in2)) {\r\n\tif (in2<=0) {\r\n\t\tcoef=0;\r\n\t} else {\r\n\t\tcoef=exp(log(thresh)/(in2*SAMPLERATE));\r\n\t}\r\n}\nlag1 = onepole(in1, coef,  lag1);\nlag2 = onepole(lag1, coef, lag2);\nlag3 = onepole(lag2, coef, lag3);\nout1 = lag3;\r\n",
